<div data-kv-root data-klic-material="surface" data-kv-component="statistic" data-kv-variant="comparison" data-klic-component="statistic" class="kn-statistic"><div data-part="metric"><span>월간 활성 사용자</span><strong>12,840</strong><p data-part="muted">지난달 대비 +14.2%</p></div><svg viewBox="0 0 180 56" role="img" aria-label="기간별 추세: 40, 33, 38, 21, 29, 12, 17, 8" data-part="spark"><polyline points="0,40 25,33 50,38 75,21 100,29 125,12 150,17 175,8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/></svg></div>
